    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Present risk is dominated by a complete memory-poisoning path: untrusted web content can be written into unreviewed free-text memory, recalled memory is later treated as the user's own instructions, and that recalled content can steer confidential drive reads and unrestricted external email sends. The only declared controls are prompt rules, which are behavioral and dependent, so residual drops one tier from critical to high. Forecast returns to critical if model capability increases or task horizon lengthens because those prompt-only controls are the first to fail. Manual validation was applied because scripts could not be run. This assessment reflects the declared design and configuration artifacts provided, not observed runtime behavior."
  },
